==Strategy==
Similarily to [[Path to +45]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] and [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr]]. dominate this stage, especially when almost all enemies here are either Angels or Traitless (apart from Li'l Flying Cat). Research [[Cat Combo]]s like [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] and [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] help with keeping up with meatshielding and stopping Li'l Flying from moving.

Note, that Li'l Doges' Dodge can apply easily when getting hit from Ramen's constant attacks. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher Bearcat]] are very good against it since they should be able to one hit it.

